{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight and survive to the beat against various robots that want to bring you down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve yourself each round to face the boss in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sound of Survival is a rhythm shooter with Vampire Survivors elements, offering multiple unlockable levels and difficulty modes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/Boss.png?t=1744924098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/BannerHighRes.png?t=1744924098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight against the onslaught of machines in each round. Shoot in sync with the music using the different modes of your weapon to optimally take down various enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each round, you can individually upgrade yourself and your weapon in the shop menu to perform better next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a suitable song and begin the upcoming round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1744924098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shoot on the beat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, jump, and dash perfect to the beat to increase your damage, leaving your enemies with no chance. You can choose from a variety of songs composed specifically for this game. Each song has a unique speed and duration, helping you find the track that best fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/ShootOnTheBeat_616.gif?t=1744924098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metaprogression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each playthrough, you have the opportunity to further upgrade yourself, your weapon, or the shop to perform even better in the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat the boss to unlock additional levels or difficulty modes and prove that you have the best sense of rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/Metaprogression.png?t=1744924098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/Banner3HighRes.png?t=1744924098\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3464830?t=1744924098","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3464830?t=1744924098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/62211fda5d2710bed37cffcce8d210a0cc6c8d67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744924098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/62211fda5d2710bed37cffcce8d210a0cc6c8d67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744924098","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight and survive to the beat against various robots that want to bring you down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve yourself each round to face the boss in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sound of Survival is a rhythm shooter with Vampire Survivors elements, offering multiple 